{"seq":2,"slug":"study-designs","title":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 流行病学研究设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/public-health/epidemiology/study-designs","wordCount":2004,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学公共卫生与预防医学-流行病学研究设计\">大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 流行病学研究设计</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>知道了如何测量疾病频率之后，下一个核心问题是：如何科学地把某个暴露因素（比如吸烟、某种饮食、某种职业接触）和某种疾病联系起来？在医学里，最理想的方法是做实验——把人随机分成两组，一组暴露一组不暴露，看结果差异。但伦理上你不可能强迫一群人吸烟二十年来验证肺癌假设。流行病学的智慧，正在于发明了一整套<strong>观察性研究设计</strong>，在不做实验的前提下逼近因果真相。</p>\n<p>研究设计是流行病学的骨架，主要分为三大类：<strong>横断面研究</strong>（同一时点测暴露和疾病，像拍快照）、<strong>队列研究</strong>（从暴露出发追踪到疾病，顺着时间往前看）和<strong>病例对照研究</strong>（从疾病出发回溯暴露，逆着时间往回看）。它们各有适用场景、各有优劣，理解何时用哪种设计、每种设计能算出什么指标，是评价一切健康研究的基本功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"研究设计的全景图\">研究设计的全景图</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流行病学研究] --&gt; B[观察性研究]&#10;    A --&gt; C[实验性研究&lt;br/&gt;随机对照试验]&#10;    B --&gt; D[描述性&lt;br/&gt;横断面/病例报告]&#10;    B --&gt; E[分析性]&#10;    E --&gt; F[队列研究&lt;br/&gt;暴露→疾病]&#10;    E --&gt; G[病例对照研究&lt;br/&gt;疾病→暴露]\">graph TD\n    A[流行病学研究] --&gt; B[观察性研究]\n    A --&gt; C[实验性研究&lt;br/&gt;随机对照试验]\n    B --&gt; D[描述性&lt;br/&gt;横断面/病例报告]\n    B --&gt; E[分析性]\n    E --&gt; F[队列研究&lt;br/&gt;暴露→疾病]\n    E --&gt; G[病例对照研究&lt;br/&gt;疾病→暴露]</pre><p>证据强度大致从弱到强排列：病例报告 &lt; 横断面 &lt; 病例对照 &lt; 队列 &lt; 随机对照试验。但&quot;更强&quot;不等于&quot;更适用&quot;——研究罕见病时，金标准的队列研究反而力不从心，病例对照才是利器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"横断面研究-健康的-快照\">横断面研究：健康的&quot;快照&quot;</h3><p>横断面研究在<strong>同一时点</strong>同时调查暴露和疾病状态，比如一次全国营养与健康调查。它能快速估计患病率、发现暴露与疾病的关联，成本低、速度快。</p>\n<p>但它有个根本缺陷：<strong>因果时序不清</strong>。假设调查发现&quot;抑郁的人运动更少&quot;，到底是缺乏运动导致抑郁，还是抑郁导致不想运动？快照无法分辨先后。因此横断面研究适合提出假设，而非确认因果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"队列研究-顺着时间追踪\">队列研究：顺着时间追踪</h3><p>队列研究先确定一群<strong>无病但暴露状态不同</strong>的人，然后随访足够长的时间，比较暴露组与非暴露组的发病率。因为暴露在前、疾病在后，时序明确，是观察性研究中因果论证力最强的设计。</p>\n<p>队列研究能直接计算<strong>相对危险度</strong>（Relative Risk）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>暴露组发病率</mtext><mtext>非暴露组发病率</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = \\frac{\\text{暴露组发病率}}{\\text{非暴露组发病率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">非暴露组发病率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">暴露组发病率</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示暴露增加风险，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示无关联，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示暴露有保护作用。</p>\n<p>历史上最著名的队列研究是<strong>英国医生研究</strong>（Doll 与 Hill，1951 年起）。他们随访了 4 万多名英国医生数十年，发现重度吸烟者死于肺癌的风险是不吸烟者的约 20 倍（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR \\approx 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>），并观察到戒烟后风险逐年下降——正是这种前瞻性的时序证据，最终让&quot;吸烟致癌&quot;从假说变成铁案。</p>\n<p>队列研究的代价是：耗时长、花费大，对于潜伏期长或罕见的疾病，需要随访极多的人极长的时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"病例对照研究-逆着时间回溯\">病例对照研究：逆着时间回溯</h3><p>病例对照研究反其道而行：先找到<strong>已患病的人</strong>（病例组）和<strong>未患病的人</strong>（对照组），再回溯比较两组过去的暴露史。它特别适合罕见病和长潜伏期疾病——研究一种万分之一发病率的罕见癌症，与其随访十万人等它发生，不如直接找来已确诊的病例。</p>\n<p>病例对照研究无法直接算发病率，因此不能算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，但可以用<strong>比值比</strong>（Odds Ratio）来近似估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = \\frac{a \\times d}{b \\times c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中四格表为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>病例组</th>\n<th>对照组</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有暴露</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无暴露</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当疾病罕见时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 的良好近似。例如一项研究中，肺癌病例组 100 人有 90 人吸烟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=90,c=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>），对照组 100 人有 50 人吸烟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=50,d=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR = \\frac{90 \\times 50}{50 \\times 10} = 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，提示吸烟者患肺癌的比值是非吸烟者的 9 倍。</p>\n<p>病例对照研究快速、廉价、适合罕见病，但极易受到<strong>回忆偏倚</strong>（患者更容易回忆起可能的&quot;病因&quot;）和<strong>对照选择偏倚</strong>的影响，这是它的软肋。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种设计的对比\">三种设计的对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>横断面</th>\n<th>病例对照</th>\n<th>队列</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间方向</td>\n<td>同时</td>\n<td>由果溯因</td>\n<td>由因及果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能算的指标</td>\n<td>患病率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、发病率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合罕见病</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合罕见暴露</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可研究多种结局</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（单一结局）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可研究多种暴露</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（单一暴露）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本与耗时</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果论证力</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记忆口诀：<strong>病例对照&quot;一果多因&quot;，队列研究&quot;一因多果&quot;</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实验性研究-随机对照试验\">实验性研究：随机对照试验</h3><p>观察性研究的金字塔之上是<strong>随机对照试验</strong>（RCT）。它通过随机分组，让混杂因素在两组间均衡分布，是确认因果和评价疗效的金标准。新冠疫苗的有效性，正是通过数万人参与的双盲 RCT 来确认的。但 RCT 受伦理和成本限制，不可能用来研究有害暴露，这也正是观察性研究永远不可替代的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>你想研究&quot;长期使用某款手机是否增加脑瘤风险&quot;，脑瘤是罕见病。你会选择队列研究还是病例对照研究？说明理由。</li>\n<li>某横断面调查发现&quot;喝咖啡的人失眠率更高&quot;，能否据此建议大家戒咖啡以改善睡眠？这个结论的逻辑漏洞在哪里？</li>\n<li>为什么病例对照研究只能算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 而不能算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>？<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 在什么条件下才能近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>？</li>\n<li>英国医生研究为什么比任何横断面调查都更有力地证明了吸烟致癌？请从&quot;时序&quot;角度分析。</li>\n<li>如果一种暴露非常罕见（如某种特殊职业接触），三种观察性设计中哪种最合适？为什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>真实连接：读医学新闻时，先看它是哪种研究设计。&quot;某食物与某病相关&quot;的横断面或病例对照研究只能提示关联，媒体却常常写成&quot;某食物致病/防病&quot;，这是科学传播中最普遍的失真。</li>\n<li>经典案例：检索 1950 年 Doll &amp; Hill 发表于《英国医学杂志》的吸烟与肺癌病例对照研究，以及后续的医生队列研究，体会两种设计如何互相印证。</li>\n<li>工具资源：循证医学的&quot;证据等级金字塔&quot;图，理解为什么系统综述和 RCT 位于顶端、专家意见位于底端。</li>\n<li>延伸思考：了解&quot;自然实验&quot;（如某政策在不同地区错时实施）如何在无法做 RCT 时提供准实验证据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课时的核心是掌握流行病学的三大观察性研究设计及其适用边界。横断面研究像快照，快速但因果时序不清；队列研究顺时间追踪，因果论证力最强、能算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，但耗时昂贵；病例对照研究逆时间回溯，适合罕见病、能算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，但易受回忆偏倚干扰。选择设计的关键在于权衡疾病/暴露的罕见程度、时间与成本、以及对因果论证力的要求。然而，即便设计再精巧，观察性研究得出的关联也未必是因果——下一课时我们将直面流行病学最深刻的问题：偏倚、混杂与因果推断。复习时建议为每种设计各找一个真实研究实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 流行病学研究设计","id":"大学公共卫生与预防医学-流行病学研究设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"研究设计的全景图","id":"研究设计的全景图"},{"level":3,"text":"横断面研究：健康的\"快照\"","id":"横断面研究-健康的-快照"},{"level":3,"text":"队列研究：顺着时间追踪","id":"队列研究-顺着时间追踪"},{"level":3,"text":"病例对照研究：逆着时间回溯","id":"病例对照研究-逆着时间回溯"},{"level":3,"text":"三种设计的对比","id":"三种设计的对比"},{"level":3,"text":"实验性研究：随机对照试验","id":"实验性研究-随机对照试验"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 疾病频率与分布的测量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/public-health/epidemiology/measuring-disease-frequency"},"next":{"title":"大学公共卫生与预防医学 — 因果推断与偏倚","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/public-health/epidemiology/causal-inference-and-bias"}}